        "original_id": "631f334f-f3b7-5f78-a739-79a9e14b5a95",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"All for Love\"\n- People: Bryan Adams, Robert John \"Mutt\" Lange, Michael Kamen, Stephen Herek, David Loughery, Charlie Sheen, Kiefer Sutherland, Chris O'Donnell, Oliver Platt, Tim Curry, Rebecca De Mornay\n- Films: The Three Musketeers (1993 film)\n- Soundtracks: The Three Musketeers: Original Motion Picture Soundtrack\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Caravan Pictures, The Kerner Entertainment Company\n\nFacts:\n- \"All for Love\" was written by Bryan Adams, Robert John \"Mutt\" Lange, and Michael Kamen for The Three Musketeers: Original Motion Picture Soundtrack.\n- The Three Musketeers is a 1993 Austrian-American action-adventure comedy film.\n- The Three Musketeers was produced by Walt Disney Pictures, Caravan Pictures, and The Kerner Entertainment Company.\n- The Three Musketeers was directed by Stephen Herek from a screenplay by David Loughery.\n- The Three Musketeers stars Charlie Sheen, Kiefer Sutherland, Chris O'Donnell, Oliver Platt, Tim Curry, and Rebecca De Mornay.\n- \"All for Love\" was released as a CD single in the United States on November 16, 1993.",
